// ─── PART IV — NEXT BUMP PLAYBOOK ───────────────────────────────────────────

next_bump_playbook:
  "On vsm-1.3 (or any future bump): (1) S0 — bump primer; (2) S1 —
   confirm gates still catch it (parametric: they re-fire by reading
   the primer header — no check edit); (3) S2 — ratified-version-current
   lists the universe; (4) S3 — migrate, covenant as co-signature;
   (5) S4 — propagate hashes/types/manifest; (6) S5 — battery + commit.
   The VERSION-CHANGE-PLAN-HOOK (VSM12, P2) will automate S2/S4
   emission as task()s once implemented."

⟦ /version_change_plan ⟧